E400             4 438 iDisImmed:
E400 3E 00       4 439 ld      a, $00                      ; Get immediate value from instruction
E402 5F          4 440 ld      e, a                        ; Get displacement lo (signed byte)
E403 16 00       4 441 ld      d, 0                        ; Default to hi byte = zero
E405 17          4 442 rla                                 ; Displacement negative?
E406 30 01       4 443 jr      nc, JRadd                   ; No, so skip
